 1168          MCW  ch,*&8\
 1175          BCE  intvr2,ijklm2,0  Integer variable?\
 1183          B\
 1184          B\
 1185          B\
 1186          B\
 1187          B\
 1188          M    mantis,w10-1  First dimension * width\
